title: openalex-mcp-server
abstract: "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for the OpenAlex scholarly catalog (270M+ works, authors, sources, institutions, topics, publishers, funders), providing entity search and filtering, group-by trend analysis, and name-to-ID resolution via autocomplete."
